# Shared acoustic model (INCLUDEd): a fluid cavity of 2 x 2 CHEXA (x 0 to 20,
# y 0 to 20, z 0 to 10), a CPYRAM on the top of one of them, a CPENTA against
# the face x = 20 and a CTETRA on a triangular face of the CPENTA, all on
# PSOLID FCTN PFLUID (MAT10, fluid grid points CD = -1); its floor z = 0 is a
# plate of 2 x 2 CQUAD4 on separate structural grid points, clamped on its
# edges and loaded at its centre. Units: mm, N, tonne, s.
